Hi Alex,

The board met today. Two decisions that change your scope:

1. Returns are in this phase. We expect about 1,800 returned items a day (8% of
   despatched lines), more in January. Returns are graded A (resell), B (refurbish) or
   C (dispose) at a returns bench and A-grade items go back into the AS/RS the same night.
   We'd like four returns benches.

2. Click & collect: we're adding 40 parcel lockers at the Elmbridge front gate for local
   customers. Orders for lockers must be sorted to a dedicated sorter chute and the
   locker system told which locker each parcel goes in.

Also, to settle the go-live date: 1 October 2027 stands, as in Oliver's procurement email.
Please ignore the 1 August date in the tender specification; it was from an older draft.

Hannah
